# The data lemma takes a filler's INTERNALS with its axiom, never the axioms
# the filler heads. :d is idle, so its domain is inert; but the domain's
# blank filler also heads a GCI, (C and D) SubClassOf Nothing, which keeps
# the filler's structure. With D below C, D is UNSATISFIABLE: INCOHERENT
# (exit 1). Consuming the filler whole dropped the GCI with no omission and
# reported this document coherent (Codex, slice 3 review).

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:C a owl:Class .
:D a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :C .
:d a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain _:x .
_:x owl:intersectionOf ( :C :D ) ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Nothing .
